  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till FN-fond f&#xf6;r att finansiera RC-systemet 2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Contribution to the Special Purpose Trust Fund for the RC system 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansieringen till RC-systemet &#xf6;kas och har separerats fr&#xe5;n UNDP. Finansieringen ska komma fr&#xe5;n tre finansieringsk&#xe4;llor som alla i grunden &#xe4;r frivilliga bidrag till FN-systemet: en koordineringsavgift (1%) p&#xe5; strikt &#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkta bidrag till FN:s utvecklingssystem, en f&#xf6;rdubbling av nuvarande kostnadsdelningsmekanism mellan FN-organ i utvecklingssystemet och en tillf&#xe4;llig, frivilligfinansierad, fond.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The funding for the RC system is increased and has been separated from the UNDP. Funding will come from three sources of funding, all of which are basically voluntary contributions to the UN system: a co-ordination fee (1%) on strictly earmarked contributions to the UN development system, a doubling of the current cost-sharing mechanism between UN agencies in the development system and a temporary, voluntarily funded, fund.</narrative>
  </description>
